[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11054.15, "timestamp": "03:04:14", "text": "岩石。是的，我需要按照里面的指示去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11055.75, "timestamp": "03:04:15", "text": "房子。是的，我要去装饰一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11063.19, "timestamp": "03:04:23", "text": "有时候，他就是一动不动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11066.95, "timestamp": "03:04:26", "text": "那让我感到害怕。每当他静止不动时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11070.07, "timestamp": "03:04:30", "text": "没错，这确实让我感到害怕。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11073.349, "timestamp": "03:04:33", "text": "等等，这是怎么回事？他没事吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11076.63, "timestamp": "03:04:36", "text": "然后我给朋友打了电话。他当时就像是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11079.11, "timestamp": "03:04:39", "text": "“医生，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11081.91, "timestamp": "03:04:41", "text": "医生，呃，你知道，如果你在游泳，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11086.389, "timestamp": "03:04:46", "text": "你不会一天24小时都在游泳吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11089.19, "timestamp": "03:04:49", "text": "然后我就想，“好吧，你说得对。你"}]